      "duration": 1.89,
      "size": 30240,
      "text": "给你一个数字，比如六十，你能把它一步步拆开吗？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "prime",
      "line_id": "def-1",
      "filename": "prime-def-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/prime-def-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.49,
      "size": 39888,
      "text": "质数只能被一和它自己整除，比如二、三、五、七。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "prime",
      "line_id": "def-2",
      "filename": "prime-def-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/prime-def-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.8,
      "size": 28800,
      "text": "它们无法再被拆分，就像搭积木时最基本的那些小块。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "tree",
      "line_id": "tree-2",
      "filename": "tree-tree-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/tree-tree-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.74,
      "size": 27792,
      "text": "每次把一个合数拆成两个因子，画出两条分支。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "tree",
      "line_id": "tree-3",
      "filename": "tree-tree-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/tree-tree-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.88,
      "size": 30096,
      "text": "当分支上出现绿色的质数，它就成了不再生长的叶子。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "unique",
      "line_id": "uni-2",
      "filename": "unique-uni-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/unique-uni-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.99,
      "size": 31824,
      "text": "六十总是二乘二乘三乘五，这就是算术基本定理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "interaction",
      "line_id": "int-2",
      "filename": "interaction-int-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/interaction-int-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.12,
      "size": 33984,
      "text": "如果输入的本身就是质数，那这棵树就只有一个孤零零的叶子。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "size": 29520,
      "text": "六十等于十二乘以五，而十二又能拆成四乘三。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prime-factorization/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.95,
      "size": 31248,
      "text": "一直拆下去，直到不能再拆，我们就完成了质因数分解。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prime-factorization",
      "section_id": "prime",
      "line_id": "def-3",
